flowchart LR
  A["Conflicting human requests"] --> F["Facilitator clarifies"]
  F --> P["Planner: versioned brief"]
  P --> C{"Client AND Operations\nconfirm same version?"}
  C -->|No| WAIT["Wait / resolve disagreement"]
  WAIT --> C
  C -->|Yes| B["Builder: candidate commit"]
  B --> T["Actual tests"]
  T --> R["Independent reviewer"]
  R -->|Changes requested · bounded| B
  R -->|Approved| S["Steward prepares evidence"]
  S --> H["Lead accepts exact delivery"]
  H --> CHANGE["New requirement: new version"]
  CHANGE --> P
